.git
.github
.claude
# Clients ship separately and aren't used by the image build — except the TV
# web app, which the image embeds and serves at /tvapp/. The last matching
# pattern wins and the exception re-includes everything under clients/xbox,
# so this block must stay ABOVE the secret and build-output patterns below,
# which then exclude those files inside clients/xbox too.
clients/
!clients/xbox/
clients/xbox/build/
clients/xbox/.svelte-kit/
# The UWP shell (its build output, packages and local signing key included)
# isn't part of the server image.
clients/xbox/shell/
# Secrets must never reach the build context: `COPY . .` in the builder stage
# would otherwise copy them into builder layers that persist in the local and
# buildx cache. Patterns are anchored to the context root unless prefixed with
# **/ — the old root-only ".env*" missed docker/.env, where the TrueNAS compose
# tells operators to put SECRET_KEY/DB_PASS.
**/.env
**/.env.*
.onscreen-deploy.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/keystore.properties
**/local.properties
docker/certs/
*.exe
bin/
dist/
coverage.out
coverage.html
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
web/.svelte-kit/
internal/webui/dist/
internal/tvui/dist/
docs/
*.md
!README.md
!LICENSE
# Not used by any image build (installer/.cache holds downloaded third-party
# binaries; screenshots/testdata are docs/tests only). clients/ is near the top.
installer/
screenshots/
testdata/
qa-media/
